   "sols": [
    [
     [
      "Sum of the interior angles = (6 &minus; 2) \u00d7 180 = 720\u00b0",
      ""
     ],
     [
      "Each interior angle = <sup>720</sup>&frasl;<sub>6</sub> = <b>120\u00b0</b>",
      "all six angles are equal because the hexagon is regular"
     ]
    ],
    [
     [
      "<i>AB</i> = <i>BC</i>, so triangle <i>ABC</i> is isosceles.",
      "all sides of a regular hexagon are equal"
